      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7311485::web::005::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The specified HPT treatment will refine MoNbTaW to an ultrafine or nanocrystalline state.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7311485::web::005::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain refinement will increase the density of grain boundaries in processed MoNbTaW.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined grain structure will activate grain-boundary sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined grain structure will improve the distribution of dislocations.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Severe plastic deformation and grain refinement will promote strain hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Post-deformation annealing will stabilize the refined microstructure and avoid adverse grain-boundary effects or embrittlement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "HPT followed by annealing will significantly improve the ductility and uniform deformability of MoNbTaW under static loading.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "HPT followed by annealing will significantly improve the ductility and uniform deformability of MoNbTaW under dynamic loading.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will retain high strength despite its improved ductility.",
